sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant FastAPI as FastAPI Server<br/>(HTTP/HTTPS)
    participant AuthMW as AuthenticationMiddleware<br/>SHA-256 Token Check
    participant Router as API Router<br/>(ChatCompletions, Embeddings, etc.)
    participant Engine as AsyncLLM Engine<br/>Model Inference
    participant gRPC as gRPC Server<br/>Port 50051 (Insecure)
    participant K8s as Kubernetes<br/>Control Plane

    Note over Client,Engine: Inference Request Flow (HTTP)

    Client->>FastAPI: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer {token}
    FastAPI->>AuthMW: Check path prefix<br/>(/v1, /v2, /inference)

    alt API Key Configured (--api-key or VLLM_API_KEY)
        AuthMW->>AuthMW: SHA-256 hash token<br/>secrets.compare_digest()
        alt Token Valid
            AuthMW->>Router: Forward request
        else Token Invalid
            AuthMW-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized
        end
    else No API Key Configured
        AuthMW->>Router: Pass through (no auth)
    end

    Router->>Engine: Inference request
    Engine->>Engine: Model forward pass (CPU)
    Engine-->>Router: Inference result (streaming/batch)
    Router-->>FastAPI: Response
    FastAPI-->>Client: JSON/SSE Response

    Note over Client,Engine: Inference Request Flow (gRPC)

    Client->>gRPC: VllmEngine.Generate()<br/>Port 50051 (no TLS)
    gRPC->>Engine: Inference request<br/>via smg-grpc-servicer
    Engine-->>gRPC: Inference result
    gRPC-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over K8s,gRPC: Health & Readiness Probes

    K8s->>FastAPI: GET /health<br/>(No auth required)
    FastAPI-->>K8s: 200 OK

    K8s->>FastAPI: GET /ready<br/>(No auth required)
    FastAPI-->>K8s: 200 OK

    K8s->>gRPC: grpc.health.v1.Health.Check()
    gRPC-->>K8s: SERVING

    Note over Client,FastAPI: Unauthenticated Operational Endpoints

    Client->>FastAPI: GET /docs
    FastAPI-->>Client: OpenAPI documentation

    Client->>FastAPI: GET /version
    FastAPI-->>Client: Version info

    Client->>FastAPI: GET /v1/models
    FastAPI->>AuthMW: Check auth (/v1 prefix)
    AuthMW->>Router: Forward (after auth check)
    Router-->>Client: Model list
